From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:37:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): mark a remembered resolution; never ask about its
 conflicts

FileMark shows 'remembered' in list and tree; MergeSummary counts
remembered conflicts apart; Mark resolved asks only about the others.

Refs plan #90
